======================================================================
CLOSED-LOOP ADAPTIVE DOSING — in-silico validation
32 patients · 4 phenotypes · 56 days (8 weeks)
======================================================================

Ground-truth best activity per phenotype (hidden from the system):
    broca_like         → syntax
    anomic_like        → naming
    wernicke_like      → conversation
    conduction_like    → script

----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. CLINICAL VALUE — mean language-ability gain over 8 weeks
----------------------------------------------------------------------
    Fixed (guideline default = naming)                +24.37 pts
    Random (pure micro-randomized trial)              +23.44 pts
    Adaptive (Thompson bandit + explore floor)        +27.41 pts

----------------------------------------------------------------------
2. CAUSAL RECOVERY — recover each phenotype's best activity
   from the randomized decision log (IPW estimator)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
      phenotype true_best_arm recovered_best_arm  correct  identified_cells  total_cells
     broca_like        syntax             syntax     True                 4            4
    anomic_like        naming             naming     True                 4            4
  wernicke_like  conversation       conversation     True                 4            4
conduction_like        script             script     True                 4            4

    Recovered the true best activity for 4/4 phenotypes (100%).

    What the adaptive policy learned to deliver (assignment share by phenotype):
    broca_like         top=syntax        (69%)  truth=syntax        ✓
    anomic_like        top=naming        (45%)  truth=naming        ✓
    wernicke_like      top=conversation  (74%)  truth=conversation  ✓
    conduction_like    top=script        (48%)  truth=script        ✓

----------------------------------------------------------------------
3. IDENTIFIABILITY — positivity is what makes the loop estimable
----------------------------------------------------------------------
    policy                        min propensity   cells est.   recovered
    adaptive (floor 0.15)                  0.046      16/16        4/4   
    greedy (no floor)                      0.250       5/16        4/4   
    → greedy collapses min propensity toward 0 (positivity fails):
      unchosen activities are never tried, so their effect is
      un-estimable. A bounded exploration floor keeps every
      activity identifiable — the reason the design must randomize.

